[PlyCount "0"]

{A knight attacks at most eight squares, which it does in the center; that is why it wants to reach the center. The closer it gets to the opposing army, the more troublesome it becomes. It therefore needs safe, protected outpost squares. It is also particularly good at double attacks (forks).}  *

