{[%csl Yc5,Gd4,Yd5,Ge4,Ye5,Yf5] Pawns in the middlegame must be defended. They are weak, and their greatest use is to form a protective shield in the center that protects one's own minor pieces and drives away the opponent's. Here, Black's pieces cannot become active because White's pawns restrict them. That is why, in the opening, players fight the opponent's central pawns with their own pawns.}  *

