[PlyCount "0"]

{In this position, White's pawns do not restrict any black pieces. Black therefore effectively has one more piece to play with. White's pawns are simply weak and need protection. Black uses the extra piece to put pressure on the pawns, which will probably soon be lost. Alternatively, Black can attack, and White has no time to promote the pawns.}  *

